# FF4: the logos and the title, then New Game. Run with:
#   OpenFF.exe --game=ff4 --nomods --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-title.drive --log=general,file --screenshot-dir=shots --screenshot-every=1
# The screenshots show the Square Enix logo, the Matrix logo, then the title as Steam's: the Amano art,
# the FINAL FANTASY IV logo, NEW GAME / QUIT GAME (LOAD GAME too with a save) with the glove, the
# copyright line. The log shows "ff4 title: up", "ff4 title: new game", the jump to t00_00 and no "Exception".
wait 14
press Down
wait 1
press Up
wait 1
press Z
until jump: ff4 60
wait 6
say ff4 title done
quit
